vyatta-dpdk-swport (0.1.28) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Build against DPDK 24.11 (elster-drones/dpdk 24.11.x, which installs
    the driver SDK headers): include ethdev_driver.h, ethdev_vdev.h and
    bus_vdev_driver.h instead of rte_ethdev_core.h; use the 21.11 names
    (RTE_MBUF_F_TX_VLAN, RTE_ETH_*_OFFLOAD_*, RTE_ETH_LINK_*; the jumbo
    frame offload flag is gone); follow the 21.11 queue release and
    xstats_get_names_by_id signatures; declare fal_pkt_mark_is_framed()
    and fal_pkt_mark_set_framed() as in the dataplane's fal_plugin.h.

